, "widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "link": null}, {"name": "scheduler", "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "scheduler"}, "link": null}, {"name": "denoise", "type": "FLOAT", "widget": {"name": "denoise"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "links": [79]}], "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.9.2", "Node name for S&R": "KSampler"}, "widgets_values": [21838, "randomize", 10, 5.5, "euler", "normal", 0.6]}, {"id": 51, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [20, 200], "size": [560, 1400], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "title": "Note: usage", "properties": {}, "widgets_values": ["# Tag T2I hires - style LoRA\nSynthetic test workflow: a tag-prompt text-to-image graph with a hires pass. It also holds a model-only LoRA loader.\n\n## Prompt style\nPositive = a quality prefix, then short tags for the subject, then the background tags:\n`masterpiece,best quality,high quality,newest,highres,absurdres,1girl,solo,looking at viewer,` + subject tags + `simple background,upper body,`\n- Short tags, no scene prose.\n- Limited palette (2 accent colors) works best.\n\n## Style LoRA\n- Put **one** `@style` tag on its own line right after the quality tags, e.g. `...absurdres,\\n@tidewalker,\\n1girl,...`. Without a tag the LoRA barely changes the look.\n- Strength 1.0 (default); 0.6 for a lighter touch. Mixing 2 styles works only loosely.\n- Strong colored-lighting tags drown the style: use neutral or soft lighting when the style matters.\n\n## Settings\n- Base KSampler: er_sde / simple, 30 steps, cfg 5, denoise 1\n- Upscale: upscaler_4x_a, then ImageScaleBy nearest-exact 0.4 (= 1.6x)\n- Hi-res KSampler: euler / normal, 10 steps, cfg 5.5, denoise 0.6\n\n## Models (installed)\n- diffusion_models: `tagmodel_base_v14.safetensors`\n- text_encoders: `tagmodel_text_v14.safetensors` (CLIPLoader type **qwen_image**)\n- vae: `shared_vae.safetensors`\n- upscale_models: `upscaler_4x_a.safetensors`\n- loras: `model_styles_anima-base1_v6.safetensors` (model-only LoRA)\n\n## Always\n- Keep framing at **upper body / portrait** for characters.\n- Keep the standard quality terms in the negative prompt.\n- Pipeline: base 896x1152 -> upscaler -> scale down -> hi-res KSampler. The hi-res denoise must stay high enough (0.6-0.8) to redraw detail.\n- Change only the positive prompt (including the `@style` line), LoRA strength, seeds and `filename_prefix` per image.\n"], "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"}, {"id": 52, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "pos": [640, 900], "size": [300, 82], "flags": {}, "order": 1, "mode": 0, "title": "Style LoRA (AI styles dump v6)", "inputs": [{"name": "model", "type": "MODEL", "link": 91}, {"name": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "link": null}, {"name": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [74, 86]}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "widgets_values": ["model_styles_anima-base1_v6.safetensors", 1.0]}], "links": [[3, 2, 0, 6, 0, "CLIP"], [4, 2, 0, 7, 0, "CLIP"], [8, 3, 0, 8, 1, "VAE"], [32, 8, 0, 22, 0, "IMAGE"], [70, 6, 0, 41, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [71, 7, 0, 41, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [72, 5, 0, 41, 3, "LATENT"], [73, 41, 0, 8, 0, "LATENT"], [74, 52, 0, 41, 0, "MODEL"], [77, 42, 0, 43, 0, "UPSCALE_MODEL"], [78, 43, 0, 44, 0, "IMAGE"], [79, 47, 0, 45, 0, "LATENT"], [80, 44, 0, 46, 0, "IMAGE"], [81, 46, 0, 47, 3, "LATENT"], [82, 8, 0, 43, 1, "IMAGE"], [83, 3, 0, 46, 1, "VAE"], [84, 45, 0, 48, 0, "IMAGE"], [85, 45, 0, 49, 0, "IMAGE"], [86, 52, 0, 47, 0, "MODEL"], [87, 6, 0, 47, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [88, 7, 0, 47, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [89, 3, 0, 45, 1, "VAE"], [91, 1, 0, 52, 0, "MODEL"]], "groups": [{"id": 2, "title": "Tag workflow", "bounding": [586.2176556531728, 198.03538763491517, 1332.281621247427, 790.782703285352], "color": "#3f789e", "flags": {}}, {"id": 6, "title": "Group", "bounding": [1986.